.TH LOCALLYCLOUD 1 "2026" "LocallyCloud" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
locallycloud \- local AWS service emulator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B locallycloud
.RI [ COMMAND ]
.br
.B locallycloud
.BR \-h | \-\-help | \-V | \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B locallycloud
emulates AWS services such as S3, DynamoDB, SQS, SNS, Lambda, API Gateway,
EventBridge, Step Functions and CloudFormation on one local endpoint, for
developing and testing applications with the AWS CLI, AWS SDKs, Terraform and
AWS SAM. It runs as a regular user and does not need Docker.
.PP
Without a command, it starts the server on
.I http://127.0.0.1:4566
and keeps running until it receives SIGINT or SIGTERM. The dashboard is at
.IR http://127.0.0.1:4566/_locallycloud/ui .
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B migrate\-s3\-encryption
Encrypt S3 object bodies stored by an earlier version with the configured
master key, then exit. Stop the server first. Rerunning resumes the remaining
buckets.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LOCALLYCLOUD_KMS_MASTER_KEY
Base64 encoding of a 32\-byte key that encrypts the stored state. Required.
Reuse the same key with the same state database; data encrypted with another
key cannot be read.
.TP
.B LOCALLYCLOUD_STATE_DB
SQLite state file. Default:
.IR ${XDG_DATA_HOME:\-~/.local/share}/locallycloud/state.sqlite3 .
.TP
.BR LOCALLYCLOUD_HOST ", " LOCALLYCLOUD_PORT
Listen address and port. Default: 127.0.0.1 and 4566.
.TP
.BR LOCALLYCLOUD_DEFAULT_REGION ", " LOCALLYCLOUD_ACCOUNT_ID
Region and account used in responses. Default: us\-east\-1 and 000000000000.
.TP
.B LOCALLYCLOUD_IAM_ENFORCEMENT
Set to
.B strict
to evaluate IAM policies. Default: permissive.
.TP
.B LOCALLYCLOUD_RUNTIME
Compute runtime for Lambda, ECS and EC2:
.BR auto ", " firecracker " or " youki
(OCI, through crun or youki). Default: auto.
.TP
.B LOCALLYCLOUD_WORK_DIR
Lambda work files. Default:
.IR ${XDG_CACHE_HOME:\-~/.cache}/locallycloud/lambda .
.TP
.B LOCALLYCLOUD_COMPUTE_MEMORY_BUDGET_MB
Memory budget for Lambda environments, in MiB. Default: 1024.
.TP
.B LOCALLYCLOUD_PG_BIN_DIR
Directory with the PostgreSQL 16 or later binaries used by RDS. By default
RDS uses PATH, then the newest version under
.IR /usr/lib/postgresql/ <version> /bin .
.TP
.B LOCALLYCLOUD_COGNITO_MAILBOX_DIR
Private directory that receives Cognito confirmation codes as JSON files.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/locallycloud/
Persistent state and local RDS databases.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/locallycloud/
Runtime caches. Restore write permission with
.B chmod \-R u+w
before deleting it.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on normal shutdown, 2 for invalid arguments or configuration, and other
non\-zero values when startup or migration fails.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
export LOCALLYCLOUD_KMS_MASTER_KEY="$(openssl rand \-base64 32)"
locallycloud
aws \-\-endpoint\-url http://127.0.0.1:4566 s3 ls
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aws (1),
.BR crun (1)
.PP
https://locallycloud.zentostudio.com
.br
https://github.com/alfredcodelabs/LocallyCloud
